  :problem/needs
  ["Every mob in the entity map with velocity and health (health from set-entity-data)"
   "The 775 attack packet spec and the pose synced one tick before attacking"
   "Eye of ender flight positions after each throw, to triangulate the stronghold"
   "Which end portal frames still lack an eye"
   "Server-side win signal: dragon entity removed, advancement, or credits game event"
   "Server difficulty: Peaceful has no blazes, piglins, endermen or dragon fight"]
  :problem/risks
  ["Attacking via interact deals no damage, or a hand-less interact gets the bot kicked"
   "Swings inside the 10-tick hurt invulnerability do nothing"
   "Wither skeletons or fireballs kill the bot mid-fight" "Looking at an enderman turns it hostile"
   "Kit given before the cross-dimension teleport is missing server-side"
   "Dragon not in view mistaken for a win"]
